{% comment %}
  Raqi — product detail page.
  2026-08-09e: the Shipping & Returns accordion's UAE line (ship_uae_body)
  previously had "Dhs. 999" hardcoded inside the merchant-editable text
  setting default. Consolidated per the free-shipping-threshold dedup task:
  the rendered output now runs the setting value through a `replace` filter
  that swaps the literal "999" for settings.raqi_free_shipping_threshold
  (Theme Settings > Raqi), so a merchant changing the global threshold
  updates this line too without editing the section setting directly. The
  setting's own default text still reads "999" so it stays self-documenting
  in the theme editor.
  2026-08-09c CORRECTION: reverted the 30ml→20ml business change back to
  30ml as the visible/active size, per explicit user correction. Matching
  logic restored to `contains '30'`, hardcoded labels restored to "30 ml"
  / "30ml", spray-count default restored (see note below on a 340+ vs 360
  discrepancy, flagged to user rather than guessed). A 20ml variant will be
  added later as a HIDDEN backend-only variant (not reflected in this
  section's UI) once the user approves Step 1-2 of the correction.
  2026-08-09 update (business change, NOW REVERTED): 30ml size discontinued,
  replaced by 20ml sitewide. Renamed the Shopify variant option value from
  "30ml" to "20ml" on all 22 products (Admin data change, not a theme edit)
  and repriced per the new price list. CRITICAL fix made alongside that data
  change: the variant-matching logic below used `variant.title contains
  '30'` to find the second size — after the rename that pattern would never
  match again and the whole size selector / sticky ATC bar would silently
  lose its second option. Changed to `contains '20'`. Also updated the
  hardcoded "30 ml" label text (size selector + sticky ATC button) to
  "20 ml", and the spray-count schema default from ~240 to ~220 (10ml/120
  sprays is unchanged, per business instruction).
  2026-08-02 update: (a) moved Fragrance Notes up, directly under the size
  selector and above Add to Cart, so it's visible without scrolling past the
  purchase controls; (b) converted all copy from locale-key-only content to
  real section settings (text/textarea with English defaults) so the section
  is actually editable from Customize — this also matches the move toward
  Shopify's own Translate & Adapt app for translation instead of a bespoke
  locale namespace (settings content IS translatable via that app).
  2026-08-02 fix: main product image was leaking the raw section.id string
  (e.g. "template--27054302331187__main") as visible text next to the photo
  on every product page. Root cause: the image_tag filter chain had
  `| append: section.id` chained onto the END of the whole filter chain
  instead of being scoped to just the `id:` parameter, so Liquid appended
  the raw section.id as a plain text node after the rendered <img> tag.
  Fixed by pre-computing the id string via assign (main_img_id) and passing
  that plain variable into image_tag, matching the same safe pattern already
  used for form_id below.
  2026-08-02c fix: on the Arabic-rendered storefront, Shopify Translate &
  Adapt had translated the variant option values (10ml -> "10مل", 30ml ->
  "30 مل"). The old code matched variants with `where: 'title', '10ml'` /
  `where: 'title', '30ml'` — an exact match against the English string —
  so on ar it silently matched nothing and the whole 30ml (and, in fact,
  10ml) price/option block disappeared. Fixed by matching on `contains '10'`
  / `contains '30'` instead, since the numeral itself stays as a plain Latin
  digit in both the English and Arabic-translated variant titles.
  2026-08-09 update (item 1): added a small "Try it" / "Live with it" caption
  under each size label in the size selector, per the RAQI business-model
  framing (10ml = trial, 30ml = the size you buy once you know it's yours).
  Both strings are section settings with these defaults, so they stay editable.
  2026-08-09 update (item 3): added a one-line "ask for a photo of your
  bottle" trust line directly under Add to Cart, mirroring the same offer
  that already exists on the About page (paragraph_3) — this repeats the
  authenticity proof at the exact moment a hesitant buyer is deciding to buy.
  2026-08-09 update (Phase 3 item 1): added a mobile-only sticky Add-to-Cart
  bar (price + 10ml/30ml size toggle + Add to Cart), fixed to the bottom of
  the viewport below 900px.
  2026-08-09 update (SEO item 6): main product image and gallery thumbnails
  had no alt attribute at all. Added alt using the media's own alt text if
  ever set, falling back to product.title — never empty/generic.
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  for variant in product.variants
    if variant.title contains '10' and ten_ml == blank
      assign ten_ml = variant
    endif
    if variant.title contains '30' and thirty_ml == blank
      assign thirty_ml = variant
    endif
  endfor
  assign scent_family = product.metafields.raqi.scent_family.value
  assign notes_top = product.metafields.raqi.notes_top.value
  assign notes_heart = product.metafields.raqi.notes_heart.value
  assign notes_base = product.metafields.raqi.notes_base.value
  assign form_id = 'raqi-product-form-' | append: section.id
  assign main_img_id = 'RaqiMainImageTag-' | append: section.id
  assign main_img_alt = product.featured_media.alt | default: product.title
  # 2026-09-03: re-indented. Each of these assign/if/endif triples used to
  # start ten spaces deeper than the one above it, reaching 140 columns by
  # the last one and running the closing tag off the edge of the editor.
  # Whitespace carries no meaning inside a liquid tag, so this is the same
  # code, only readable. No logic changed.
  assign lbl_select_size = section.settings.select_size_label
  if lbl_select_size == blank
    assign lbl_select_size = 'raqi.product.select_size' | t
  endif
  assign lbl_fragrance_notes = section.settings.fragrance_notes_label
  if lbl_fragrance_notes == blank
    assign lbl_fragrance_notes = 'raqi.product.fragrance_notes' | t
  endif
  assign lbl_note_top = section.settings.note_top_label
  if lbl_note_top == blank
    assign lbl_note_top = 'raqi.product.note_top' | t
  endif
  assign lbl_note_heart = section.settings.note_heart_label
  if lbl_note_heart == blank
    assign lbl_note_heart = 'raqi.product.note_heart' | t
  endif
  assign lbl_note_base = section.settings.note_base_label
  if lbl_note_base == blank
    assign lbl_note_base = 'raqi.product.note_base' | t
  endif
  assign lbl_add_to_cart = section.settings.add_to_cart_label
  if lbl_add_to_cart == blank
    assign lbl_add_to_cart = 'raqi.product.add_to_cart' | t
  endif
  assign lbl_trust_1 = section.settings.trust_1
  if lbl_trust_1 == blank
    assign lbl_trust_1 = 'raqi.product.trust_1' | t
  endif
  assign lbl_trust_2 = section.settings.trust_2
  if lbl_trust_2 == blank
    assign lbl_trust_2 = 'raqi.product.trust_2' | t
  endif
  assign lbl_trust_3 = section.settings.trust_3
  if lbl_trust_3 == blank
    assign lbl_trust_3 = 'raqi.product.trust_3' | t
  endif
  assign lbl_shipping_returns = section.settings.shipping_returns_label
  if lbl_shipping_returns == blank
    assign lbl_shipping_returns = 'raqi.product.shipping_returns' | t
  endif
  assign lbl_product_info = section.settings.product_info_label
  if lbl_product_info == blank
    assign lbl_product_info = 'raqi.product.product_info' | t
  endif
  assign lbl_ten_caption = section.settings.ten_ml_caption
  if lbl_ten_caption == blank
    assign lbl_ten_caption = 'Try it'
  endif
  assign lbl_thirty_caption = section.settings.thirty_ml_caption
  if lbl_thirty_caption == blank
    assign lbl_thirty_caption = 'Live with it'
  endif
  assign lbl_photo_proof = section.settings.photo_proof_text
  if lbl_photo_proof == blank
    assign lbl_photo_proof = "Want proof? Ask and we'll send a photo of the bottle yours was poured from, plus the batch date."
  endif
  assign raqi_ship_threshold = settings.raqi_free_shipping_threshold | default: 999
-%}
<div class="raqi-section" id="RaqiProductSection-{{ section.id }}" style="padding:36px 0 72px;">
  <div class="raqi-container">

    <p class="raqi-breadcrumb" style="font:400 10.5px var(--raqi-font-body);letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 32px;">
      <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">{{ section.settings.breadcrumb_root | default: 'All perfumes' }}</a>
      {%- if product.type != blank %} / {{ product.type }}{% endif %} / {{ product.vendor }}
    </p>

    <div class="raqi-product-grid">
      <div class="raqi-product-gallery">
        <div class="raqi-product-gallery__main" id="RaqiMainImage-{{ section.id }}">
          {%- if product.featured_media != blank -%}
            {{ product.featured_media.preview_image | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', id: main_img_id, alt: main_img_alt }}
          {%- else -%}
            <div class="raqi-photo-placeholder" style="width:100%;height:100%;"><span class="raqi-photo-placeholder__label">{{ section.settings.photo_placeholder | default: 'Product photo' }}</span></div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        {%- if product.media.size > 1 -%}
          <div class="raqi-product-gallery__thumbs">
            {%- for media in product.media limit: 3 -%}
              <button type="button" class="raqi-product-gallery__thumb{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" data-raqi-thumb data-full="{{ media.preview_image | image_url: width: 1000 }}">
                {{ media.preview_image | image_url: width: 140 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: media.alt | default: product.title }}
              </button>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <div class="raqi-product-info">
        <p class="raqi-micro-label">{{ product.vendor | upcase }}</p>
        <h1 class="raqi-product-title">{{ product.title }}</h1>
        <div class="raqi-product-title-rule"></div>
        <p class="raqi-product-category-line">
          {{- product.type | default: 'Eau de Parfum' }} &middot; {{ section.settings.authentic_decant_label | default: 'Authentic decant' }}
          {%- if scent_family != blank %} &middot; {{ scent_family }}{% endif -%}
        </p>

        <div class="raqi-product-price" id="RaqiPrice-{{ section.id }}">Dhs. {{ current_variant.price | money_without_currency }}</div>

        {%- if product.description != blank -%}
          <div class="raqi-product-desc">{{ product.description }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- form 'product', product, id: form_id, novalidate: 'novalidate' -%}
          <p class="raqi-micro-label" style="margin-bottom:12px;">{{ lbl_select_size}}</p>
          <div class="raqi-size-select" id="RaqiSizeSelect-{{ section.id }}">
            {%- if ten_ml -%}
              <label class="raqi-size-option{% if current_variant.id == ten_ml.id %} is-active{% endif %}">
                <input type="radio" name="id" value="{{ ten_ml.id }}" class="raqi-visually-hidden" data-raqi-variant-radio data-price="{{ ten_ml.price | money_without_currency }}" {% if current_variant.id == ten_ml.id %}checked{% endif %} {% unless ten_ml.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
                <span class="raqi-size-option__label">10 ml</span>
                <span class="raqi-size-option__caption">{{ lbl_ten_caption }}</span>
                <span class="raqi-size-option__meta">Dhs. {{ ten_ml.price | money_without_currency }} &middot; {{ section.settings.ten_ml_sprays | default: '≈ 80 sprays' }}</span>
              </label>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if thirty_ml -%}
              <label class="raqi-size-option{% if current_variant.id == thirty_ml.id %} is-active{% endif %}">
                <input type="radio" name="id" value="{{ thirty_ml.id }}" class="raqi-visually-hidden" data-raqi-variant-radio data-price="{{ thirty_ml.price | money_without_currency }}" {% if current_variant.id == thirty_ml.id %}checked{% endif %} {% unless thirty_ml.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
                <span class="raqi-size-option__label">30 ml</span>
                <span class="raqi-size-option__caption">{{ lbl_thirty_caption }}</span>
                <span class="raqi-size-option__meta">Dhs. {{ thirty_ml.price | money_without_currency }} &middot; {{ section.settings.thirty_ml_sprays | default: '≈ 360 sprays' }}</span>
              </label>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>

          {%- if notes_top != blank or notes_heart != blank or notes_base != blank -%}
            <div class="raqi-notes-block" id="RaqiNotesBlock-{{ section.id }}">
              <p class="raqi-micro-label">{{ lbl_fragrance_notes}}</p>
              {%- if notes_top != blank -%}<p><span class="raqi-note-label">{{ lbl_note_top}}</span> — {{ notes_top }}</p>{%- endif -%}
              {%- if notes_heart != blank -%}<p><span class="raqi-note-label">{{ lbl_note_heart}}</span> — {{ notes_heart }}</p>{%- endif -%}
              {%- if notes_base != blank -%}<p><span class="raqi-note-label">{{ lbl_note_base}}</span> — {{ notes_base }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- comment -%}
            2026-09-03: this button was already rendered disabled when the
            variant is unavailable, but its label still read "Add to Cart —
            Dhs. N", so it looked like a button that had simply stopped
            working. Say why instead. selected_or_first_available_variant
            falls back to the first variant when NO variant is available, so
            current_variant.available is the right test for "nothing on this
            page can be bought"; when only one size is out, that size's radio
            is disabled and the button keeps its normal priced label.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <button type="submit" name="add" id="RaqiSubmit-{{ section.id }}" class="raqi-btn raqi-btn-accent" style="width:100%;margin-top:20px;" {% unless current_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
            <span id="RaqiSubmitText-{{ section.id }}" data-add-label="{{ lbl_add_to_cart}}" data-add-label-priced="{{ lbl_add_to_cart}} — Dhs. {{ current_variant.price | money_without_currency }}">
              {%- if current_variant.available -%}
                {{- lbl_add_to_cart}} — Dhs. {{ current_variant.price | money_without_currency -}}
              {%- else -%}
                {{- 'products.product.out_of_stock' | t -}}
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
          </button>
          <p class="raqi-photo-proof-line" id="RaqiPhotoProof-{{ section.id }}">{{ lbl_photo_proof }}</p>
          <div class="raqi-product__message" id="RaqiFormMessage-{{ section.id }}" role="alert" aria-live="assertive"></div>
        {%- endform -%}

        <div class="raqi-trust-row">
          <span>&#10003; {{ lbl_trust_1}}</span>
          <span>&#10003; {{ lbl_trust_2}}</span>
          <span>&#10003; {{ lbl_trust_3}}</span>
        </div>

        <details class="raqi-accordion" open>
          <summary class="raqi-accordion__summary">{{ lbl_shipping_returns}}</summary>
          <div class="raqi-accordion__body">
            <p><strong>{{ section.settings.ship_uae_label | default: 'Across the UAE —' }}</strong> {{ section.settings.ship_uae_body | default: 'next-day delivery, free over Dhs. 999.' | replace: '999', raqi_ship_threshold }}</p>
            {% comment %}
              ⚠️ LEGALLY SENSITIVE — RETURN POLICY WORDING. DO NOT EDIT CASUALLY.

              This text is legally sensitive (return policy wording). Any future
              rewrite/republish of templates/product.json must manually verify
              this text hasn't reverted to an older or auto-translated version
              before publishing — this section previously reverted silently when
              the block's instance ID changed during a template rewrite on
              2026-08-02.

              WHY IT BREAKS SILENTLY (read before touching templates/product.json):
              The English source of this line is the `returns_body` section
              setting, stored in templates/product.json under sections.main.
              The Arabic customers actually read is NOT in locales/ar.json — it
              is a Shopify Translate & Adapt override on the setting itself,
              stored against the key:
                  section.product.json.main.returns_body:152ydzhiz8y1k
              That key is (section instance id) + (digest of the English source
              string). If EITHER the section/block instance id changes (template
              rewrite, section re-add, theme duplication) OR the English default
              text changes by even one character, the digest no longer matches,
              the Arabic override is orphaned, and the storefront silently falls
              back to English or to a machine translation. Nothing errors. Nothing
              warns. It just quietly becomes the wrong legal text.

              APPROVED ARABIC (must render exactly this on /ar product pages):
                الإرجاع — يمكن إرجاع العبوات غير المفتوحة خلال 14 يوماً لاسترداد كامل
                للمبلغ. العبوات المفتوحة لا يمكن إعادة بيعها، لذلك لا يمكننا استرجاعها —
                لكن إذا وصلك طلب تالف أو غير مطابق لما طلبته، راسلنا وسنستبدله لك.

              CHECKLIST after ANY edit to templates/product.json or to the
              returns_body default below:
                1. Re-query the theme's translations and confirm a translation
                   still exists for section.product.json.main.returns_body,
                   and that `outdated` is false.
                2. Compare its value character-for-character with the approved
                   Arabic above.
                3. Load a product page in Arabic and read the rendered line.
                4. Only then publish.

              NOTE: locales/ar.json previously carried a third, divergent Arabic
              wording under `raqi.product.returns_body`. It rendered nowhere (this
              line reads section.settings directly — there is no `| t` fallback for
              returns copy) and was removed on 2026-08-16 to stop it being mistaken
              for the live text. Do not re-add it.
            {% endcomment %}
            <p><strong>{{ section.settings.returns_label | default: 'Returns —' }}</strong> {{ section.settings.returns_body | default: "unopened decants can be returned within 14 days for a full refund. Opened decants can't be resold, so we can't take them back — but if something arrives damaged or isn't what you ordered, message us and we'll replace it." }}</p>
            <p class="raqi-accordion__footnote">{{ section.settings.ship_footnote_pre | default: 'Questions?' }} <a href="{{ pages.contact.url | default: '/pages/contact' }}">{{ section.settings.ship_footnote_whatsapp | default: 'Contact us on WhatsApp' }}</a> {{ section.settings.ship_footnote_or | default: 'or read the full' }} <a href="{{ pages['shipping-policy'].url | default: '/pages/shipping-policy' }}">{{ section.settings.ship_footnote_policy | default: 'Shipping Policy' }}</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        {%- if product.description != blank -%}
          <div class="raqi-accordion">
            <p class="raqi-micro-label" style="margin:18px 0 0;">{{ lbl_product_info}}</p>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="raqi-sticky-atc" id="RaqiStickyATC-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="raqi-sticky-atc__price" id="RaqiStickyPrice-{{ section.id }}">Dhs. {{ current_variant.price | money_without_currency }}</div>
    <div class="raqi-sticky-atc__sizes" id="RaqiStickySizes-{{ section.id }}">
      {%- if ten_ml -%}
        <button type="button" class="raqi-sticky-atc__size{% if current_variant.id == ten_ml.id %} is-active{% endif %}" data-raqi-sticky-size="{{ ten_ml.id }}" {% unless ten_ml.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>10ml</button>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if thirty_ml -%}
        <button type="button" class="raqi-sticky-atc__size{% if current_variant.id == thirty_ml.id %} is-active{% endif %}" data-raqi-sticky-size="{{ thirty_ml.id }}" {% unless thirty_ml.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>30ml</button>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="raqi-btn raqi-btn-accent raqi-sticky-atc__cta" id="RaqiStickyCta-{{ section.id }}" {% unless current_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>{% if current_variant.available %}{{ lbl_add_to_cart }}{% else %}{{ 'products.product.out_of_stock' | t }}{% endif %}</button>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .raqi-product-grid{ display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:52px; }
  .raqi-product-gallery__main{ height:520px;background:var(--raqi-bg-panel);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden; }
  .raqi-product-gallery__main img{ width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover; }
  .raqi-product-gallery__thumbs{ display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:10px; }
  .raqi-product-gallery__thumb{ width:72px;height:72px;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--raqi-rule);background:none;cursor:pointer;overflow:hidden; }
  .raqi-product-gallery__thumb.is-active{ border-color:var(--raqi-accent); }
  .raqi-product-gallery__thumb img{ width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover; }
  .raqi-product-title{ font-family:var(--raqi-font-display);font-weight:400;font-size:42px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:.02em;color:var(--raqi-ink);margin:14px 0 16px; }
  .raqi-product-title-rule{ width:44px;height:1px;background:var(--raqi-accent);margin-bottom:16px; }
  .raqi-product-category-line{ font:400 11px var(--raqi-font-body);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);margin:0 0 20px; }
  .raqi-product-price{ font-family:var(--raqi-font-body);font-weight:500;font-size:30px;color:var(--raqi-ink);margin:0 0 20px; }
  .raqi-product-desc{ font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);max-width:420px;margin:0 0 28px; }
  .raqi-visually-hidden{ position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0; }
  .raqi-size-select{ display:flex;gap:12px;max-width:420px;margin-bottom:20px; }
  .raqi-size-option{ flex:1;border:1px solid var(--raqi-rule);padding:14px;cursor:pointer;display:block; }
  .raqi-size-option.is-active{ border-color:var(--raqi-ink);background:var(--raqi-ink); }
  .raqi-size-option.is-active .raqi-size-option__label, .raqi-size-option.is-active .raqi-size-option__meta, .raqi-size-option.is-active .raqi-size-option__caption{ color:var(--raqi-bg-page); }
  .raqi-size-option__label{ display:block;font-family:var(--raqi-font-body);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;color:var(--raqi-ink);margin-bottom:2px; }
  .raqi-size-option__caption{ display:block;font:500 10px var(--raqi-font-body);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--raqi-accent);margin-bottom:6px; }
  .raqi-size-option.is-active .raqi-size-option__caption{ opacity:.9; }
  .raqi-size-option__meta{ display:block;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);opacity:.9; }
  .raqi-notes-block{ border-top:1px solid var(--raqi-rule);border-bottom:1px solid var(--raqi-rule);padding:18px 0;margin-bottom:20px; }
  .raqi-note-label{ font-family:var(--raqi-font-display);font-style:normal;color:var(--raqi-accent);font-size:14px; }
  .raqi-photo-proof-line{ font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);margin:14px 0 0; }
  .raqi-trust-row{ display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);margin:22px 0; }
  .raqi-accordion{ border-top:1px solid var(--raqi-rule);padding:18px 0; }
  .raqi-accordion__summary{ cursor:pointer;font:500 12px var(--raqi-font-body);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--raqi-ink);list-style:none; }
  .raqi-accordion__summary::-webkit-details-marker{ display:none; }
  .raqi-accordion__summary::after{ content:'+'; float:right; }
  details[open] > .raqi-accordion__summary::after{ content:'−'; }
  .raqi-accordion__body{ font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--raqi-text-muted);margin-top:14px; }
  .raqi-accordion__body a{ color:var(--raqi-accent);text-decoration:underline; }
  .raqi-product__message{ margin-top:10px;font-size:13px; }
  .raqi-product__message:empty{ display:none; }
  .raqi-product__message--error{ color:#b3261e; }

  .raqi-sticky-atc{ display:none; }
  @media (max-width:900px){
    .raqi-sticky-atc{
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
      position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:30;
      background:var(--raqi-bg-page);border-top:1px solid var(--raqi-rule);
      padding:10px 14px;box-shadow:0 -2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
    }
    .raqi-sticky-atc__price{ font:500 14px var(--raqi-font-body);color:var(--raqi-ink);white-space:nowrap; }
    .raqi-sticky-atc__sizes{ display:flex;gap:6px; }
    .raqi-sticky-atc__size{ font:500 11px var(--raqi-font-body);border:1px solid var(--raqi-rule);background:none;padding:6px 9px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--raqi-text-muted); }
    .raqi-sticky-atc__size.is-active{ border-color:var(--raqi-ink);color:var(--raqi-ink);background:var(--raqi-bg-panel); }
    .raqi-sticky-atc__cta{ flex:1;margin:0;padding:10px 12px;font-size:12.5px;white-space:nowrap; }
  }

  @media (max-width:900px){
    .raqi-product-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px; }
    .raqi-breadcrumb{ display:none; }
    .raqi-product-gallery__thumbs{ display:none; }
    .raqi-section#RaqiProductSection-{{ section.id }}{ padding-bottom:88px; }
  }
</style>

<script>
(function(){
  try {
    var sectionId = {{ section.id | json }};
    var root = document.getElementById('RaqiProductSection-' + sectionId);
    if (!root) return;
    var isMobile = window.matchMedia('(max-width:900px)').matches;

    var priceEl = document.getElementById('RaqiPrice-' + sectionId);
    var submitText = document.getElementById('RaqiSubmitText-' + sectionId);
    var radios = root.querySelectorAll('#RaqiSizeSelect-' + sectionId + ' [data-raqi-variant-radio]');

    var stickyPrice = document.getElementById('RaqiStickyPrice-' + sectionId);
    var stickyCta = document.getElementById('RaqiStickyCta-' + sectionId);
    var stickySizeBtns = root.querySelectorAll('#RaqiStickySizes-' + sectionId + ' [data-raqi-sticky-size]');

    radios.forEach(function(radio){
      radio.addEventListener('change', function(){
        try {
          var price = radio.getAttribute('data-price');
          if (priceEl && price) priceEl.textContent = 'Dhs. ' + price;
          if (submitText && price) {
            submitText.textContent = isMobile ? submitText.getAttribute('data-add-label') : (submitText.getAttribute('data-add-label') + ' — Dhs. ' + price);
          }
          radios.forEach(function(r){
            var label = r.closest('.raqi-size-option');
            if (label) label.classList.toggle('is-active', r.checked);
          });
          if (stickyPrice && price) stickyPrice.textContent = 'Dhs. ' + price;
          stickySizeBtns.forEach(function(b){
            b.classList.toggle('is-active', b.getAttribute('data-raqi-sticky-size') === radio.value);
          });
        } catch(e) {}
      });
    });
    // 2026-09-03: on mobile this line shortens the button by dropping the price
    // from its label. When the variant is unavailable the span holds the
    // out-of-stock label instead, and rewriting it here would put a
    // working-looking "Add to Cart" back onto a dead button — so skip it while
    // the button is disabled. The change handler below cannot reach this label
    // either, because an unavailable size's radio is rendered disabled and so
    // never fires a change event.
    var submitBtnEl = submitText ? submitText.closest('button') : null;
    if (isMobile && submitText && !(submitBtnEl && submitBtnEl.disabled)) { submitText.textContent = submitText.getAttribute('data-add-label'); }

    stickySizeBtns.forEach(function(btn){
      btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        try {
          var variantId = btn.getAttribute('data-raqi-sticky-size');
          var radio = root.querySelector('#RaqiSizeSelect-' + sectionId + ' input[value="' + variantId + '"]');
          if (radio && !radio.checked) {
            radio.checked = true;
            radio.dispatchEvent(new Event('change', { bubbles: true }));
          }
        } catch(e) {}
      });
    });
    if (stickyCta) {
      stickyCta.addEventListener('click', function(){
        try {
          var submitBtn = document.getElementById('RaqiSubmit-' + sectionId);
          if (submitBtn) submitBtn.click();
        } catch(e) {}
      });
    }

    var thumbs = root.querySelectorAll('[data-raqi-thumb]');
    var mainImg = document.getElementById('RaqiMainImageTag-' + sectionId);
    thumbs.forEach(function(thumb){
      thumb.addEventListener('click', function(){
        try {
          if (mainImg && thumb.dataset.full) mainImg.src = thumb.dataset.full;
          thumbs.forEach(function(t){ t.classList.remove('is-active'); });
          thumb.classList.add('is-active');
        } catch(e) {}
      });
    });

    var form = document.getElementById({{ form_id | json }});
    if (!form) return;
    function showMessage(text, isError){
      try {
        var msg = document.getElementById('RaqiFormMessage-' + sectionId);
        if (!msg) return;
        msg.textContent = text || '';
        msg.classList.toggle('raqi-product__message--error', !!isError);
      } catch(e){}
    }
    form.addEventListener('submit', function(event){
      event.preventDefault();
      try {
        var submitBtn = document.getElementById('RaqiSubmit-' + sectionId);
        if (submitBtn) submitBtn.setAttribute('aria-busy','true');
        showMessage('');
        var formData = new FormData(form);
        fetch('/cart/add.js', { method:'POST', headers:{Accept:'application/json'}, body:formData })
          .then(function(r){ return r.json().catch(function(){return {};}).then(function(d){ return {ok:r.ok, data:d}; }); })
          .then(function(result){
            if (result.ok) {
              try { document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:refresh', { detail:{open:true} })); }
              catch(e){ showMessage('Added to cart', false); }
            } else {
              var msg = (result.data && (result.data.description || result.data.message)) || 'Something went wrong. Please try again.';
              showMessage(msg, true);
            }
          })
          .catch(function(){ showMessage('Something went wrong. Please try again.', true); })
          .finally(function(){ try { if (submitBtn) submitBtn.removeAttribute('aria-busy'); } catch(e){} });
      } catch(e) { showMessage('Something went wrong. Please try again.', true); }
    });
  } catch(e) {}
})();
</script>

